{"2795110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Petal Runner", "steam_appid": 2795110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Slice-of-Life RPG</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795110/extras/ef6188a2a91856664e7ec41dfe9a0cdb.poster.avif?t=1782161606\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795110/extras/ef6188a2a91856664e7ec41dfe9a0cdb.webm?t=1782161606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795110/extras/ef6188a2a91856664e7ec41dfe9a0cdb.mp4?t=1782161606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Petal Runner</strong> is a coming-of-age story set in a solarpunk, pixel-powered open world — dripping with Game Boy Color-era charm and a whole lot of heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Cali and their foxy sidekick Kira as the two fulfill their lifelong dream of becoming Petal Runners–an elite crew of motorcycle couriers. Deliver and install the newest, most impressive generation of digital pets across a vibrant coastal city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome To Sapphire Valley</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795110/extras/10459b60581bbb417f6194244d406c37.poster.avif?t=1782161606\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795110/extras/10459b60581bbb417f6194244d406c37.webm?t=1782161606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795110/extras/10459b60581bbb417f6194244d406c37.mp4?t=1782161606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sapphire Valley is a coastal metropolis split into four districts, each with its own vibe, colour palette, and culture. You’ll meet all types of people, androids, and cute digital pets bursting with personalities that range from &quot;charming,&quot; to &quot;wacky,&quot; to &quot;wait, stop… scratch-’n-sniff stickers are not actually food!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every gorgeous corner at your own pace. Take on side jobs. Chat up the locals — human or otherwise. Get into trouble. Get out of trouble. Get scolded by your boss because you were busy with heroic hijinks. (Whoops on that one.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hop On Your Bike!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795110/extras/88133c12d7a69e4039f3da083bd53217.poster.avif?t=1782161606\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795110/extras/88133c12d7a69e4039f3da083bd53217.webm?t=1782161606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795110/extras/88133c12d7a69e4039f3da083bd53217.mp4?t=1782161606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let the retro-inspired visuals fool you — Cali's hand-crafted motorcycle feels satisfying and intuitive as it cruises down the street. And the best part? You don’t have to get off your bike to talk to NPC’s! Hooray! (This was a whole thing during development, in case you were wondering!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your routes across highways and back roads, make your deliveries, and try not to get too distracted by the incredible scenery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(WARNING: You will probably get distracted by the scenery. It’s REALLY pretty.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wholesome Storytelling</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795110/extras/5d217cbb1d08285e3c68696eaf82c3dd.poster.avif?t=1782161606\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795110/extras/5d217cbb1d08285e3c68696eaf82c3dd.webm?t=1782161606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795110/extras/5d217cbb1d08285e3c68696eaf82c3dd.mp4?t=1782161606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of Petal Runner is the lifelong friendship between Cali and Kira. Two best friends on a motorcycle, chasing a dream, making deliveries, cracking jokes — living the life they always wanted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beneath the candy-coloured pixels and upbeat soundtrack, something isn't quite right. And just maybe, buried under all the sea breeze and neon, there are secrets lurking in the very heart of the corporation that built this world…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With hand-crafted pixel visuals by artist Brandon James Greer (<strong>YouTube: BJGpixel</strong>), and story contributions from award-winning writer Adam Dolin (God of War, Horizon: Forbidden West), enjoy this emotional (but still totally cozy and fun!) story inspired by classic gaming and 90s anime.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795110/extras/4c2c9b2d1bc52bf56523e1852a710254.poster.avif?t=1782161606\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795110/extras/4c2c9b2d1bc52bf56523e1852a710254.webm?t=1782161606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795110/extras/4c2c9b2d1bc52bf56523e1852a710254.mp4?t=1782161606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A solarpunk, slice-of-life, pixel art-powered open world</strong> bursting with Game Boy Color-era charm!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying motorcycle traversal</strong> through lush, lovingly-detailed pixel art streets, highways, and back roads.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A vibrant cast</strong> of people, androids, and digital pets — offering diverse stories, quirks, and hot takes on food etiquette.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse, quirky minigames</strong> designed to challenge and delight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oodles of digital pets</strong> to meet, deliver, and help settle into their new homes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A wholesome (but gripping) main campaign</strong> with a corporate mystery simmering underneath...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four distinct districts</strong> to explore, each with unique vibes, characters, and colour palettes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side quests, mysteries, and hijinks</strong> — ghost hunts, heists, missing persons, concerts gone wrong... and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An original chiptune soundtrack</strong> that knows exactly when to make you smile and when to make you ~ feel things ~</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Slice-of-Life RPG</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinl