personalities that range from &quot;charming,&quot; to &quot;wacky,&quot; to &quot;wait, stop… scratch-’n-sniff stickers are not actually food!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every gorgeous corner at your own pace. Take on side jobs. Chat up the locals — human or otherwise. Get into trouble. Get out of trouble. Get scolded by your boss because you were busy with heroic hijinks. (Whoops on that one.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hop On Your Bike!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795110/extras/88133c12d7a69e4039f3da083bd53217.poster.avif?t=1782161606\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795110/extras/88133c12d7a69e4039f3da083bd53217.webm?t=1782161606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795110/extras/88133c12d7a69e4039f3da083bd53217.mp4?t=1782161606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let the retro-inspired visuals fool you — Cali's hand-crafted motorcycle feels satisfying and intuitive as it cruises down the street. And the best part? You don’t have to get off your bike to talk to NPC’s! Hooray! (This was a whole thing during development, in case you were wondering!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your routes across highways and back roads, make your deliveries, and try not to get too distracted by the incredible scenery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(WARNING: You will probably get distracted by the scenery. It’s REALLY pretty.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wholesome Storytelling</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.