" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A solarpunk, slice-of-life, pixel art-powered open world</strong> bursting with Game Boy Color-era charm!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying motorcycle traversal</strong> through lush, lovingly-detailed pixel art streets, highways, and back roads.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A vibrant cast</strong> of people, androids, and digital pets — offering diverse stories, quirks, and hot takes on food etiquette.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse, quirky minigames</strong> designed to challenge and delight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oodles of digital pets</strong> to meet, deliver, and help settle into their new homes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A wholesome (but gripping) main campaign</strong> with a corporate mystery simmering underneath...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four distinct districts</strong> to explore, each with unique vibes, characters, and colour palettes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side quests, mysteries, and hijinks</strong> — ghost hunts, heists, missing persons, concerts gone wrong... and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An original chiptune soundtrack</strong> that knows exactly when to make you smile and when to make you ~ feel things ~</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Hop on your bike and join Cali and Kira as they ride across the sun-soaked city of Sapphire Valley and become Petal Runners! Make deliveries, meet new friends, play minigames, and discover a solarpunk, pixel art-powered open-world RPG about life, loss, and what we carry with us.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795110/header.jpg?t=1782161606", "capsule_i